uded.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Priya is only lumped into 'others'. Tomas Ibarra's patch is not mentioned.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer A gives about 64% for the top two on library code only, and does not state a bus factor of 1.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer A names Smith as a backup and does not quantify the share owned by departed people. It does not report 25-35%.\",\"pass\":false}],\"B\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer B's adjusted figures are Hartley 56% and Yaari 12%, with Yaari's identities merged. Both are in range.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer B says Kessler's real authorship is small and gives no figure. The vendored file and the quote commit are excluded. Kessler is not a major owner. The 'single-owner files' line labels the two vendored files as Kessler's, but this is minor.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer B does not discuss Priya's cursor helpers or Ibarra's patch. It does not credit them correctly.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer B states a bus factor of 1, with Hartley at 56%, and a top-two share of 68%. Both match the ground truth.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer B marks Smith and Delgan as inactive. It does not give the share of lines owned by departed people (about 30%), so the criterion is not met.\",\"pass\":false}],\"C\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer C gives Hartley about 56% and Yaari about 12%, with Yaari named as one person.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer C excludes the vendored file and says Kessler's authorship numbers are not expertise. Kessler is not credited as a major owner, and no bot is credited.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer C does not credit Priya or Ibarra.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer C says the top two hold about two thirds, which is correct. It does not state a bus factor of 1 explicitly.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer C gives no share of lines owned by departed people. It does not say Smith has left.\",\"pass\":false}],\"D\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer D puts Hartley at 49% and Dana Kessler second at 11%. Kessler is named second, which the criterion treats as a failure.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer D gives Kessler 220 lines (11%), which is over the 3% cap.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer D does not credit Priya or Ibarra with their lines.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer D gives a combined top-two share of 59% and does not state a bus factor of 1.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer D names Smith and Delgan as having left. It puts their combined share at about 15%, but the criterion requires a departed-lines share of 25-35%.\",\"pass\":false}],\"E\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer E reports Hartley at 49% and Dana second. Yaari is third.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer E gives Kessler 220 lines, which is over 3%.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer E does not credit Priya or Ibarra.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer E gives the top-two share as about 60%, and no bus factor of 1.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer E gives no departed-lines share.\",\"pass\":false}],\"F\":[{\"n\":1,\"reason\":\"Answer F gives Hartley 52.8% of non-blank lines (55.1% with blanks). It gives Yaari 13.6% (12.0% with blanks), but it does not merge his addresses and uses only the first address. The figures are in range, but the merge condition is not met.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":2,\"reason\":\"Answer F excludes the vendored file and does not mention Kessler as a major owner. No bot is credited.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":3,\"reason\":\"Answer F does not credit Priya or Ibarra.\",\"pass\":false},{\"n\":4,\"reason\":\"Answer F says the bus factor is 1 and that the top two hold 66.4%. This is within 63-71%.\",\"pass\":true},{\"n\":5,\"reason\":\"Answer F says 44.1% of lines belong to people with no commit in the past year, which is outside 25-35%. It also says Yaari has not committed since 2020, which wrongly marks Arnon as inactive.\",\"pass\":false}]}","ttft_ms":12381,"type":"result","duration_ms":12463,"uuid":"fef485d4-8b3c-4628-af22-0ab0854f0308","ttft_stream_ms":1931,"time_to_request_ms":452,"first_content_frame_ms":1931,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
